{
    "version": "0.1.3",
    "description": "青简 Qingjian：用 Rust 写的拼音输入法，候选词旁多一条正在学的语言的译词",
    "homepage": "https://qingjian.app",
    "license": "GPL-3.0",
    "url": "https://github.com/qingjian-team/qingjian/releases/download/windows-v0.1.3/qingjian-0.1.3-windows-x86_64-setup.exe",
    "checkver": {
        "github": "https://github.com/qingjian-team/qingjian"
    },
    "hash": "sha256:257c3b4008b6f8f1aac0666100eab51fa6646e9ae49df51fbce58cbf3eefa52c",
    "installer": {
        "args": [
            "/VERYSILENT",
            "/NORESTART",
            "/DIR=$dir"
        ]
    },
    "post_uninstall": [
        "Start-Process \"$dir\\unins000.exe\" -Wait -ArgumentList '/VERYSILENT','/NORESTART'"
    ],
    "notes": [
        "系统注册已完成；若输入法未即时生效：新打开的窗口通常直接可用（旧窗口需重开），任务栏等系统组件需重启 ctfmon（taskkill /f /im ctfmon.exe）或重新启动资源管理器，仍无效再注销或重启。"
    ],
    "bin": "qingjian-server.exe",
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "qingjian-server.exe",
            "qingjian"
        ]
    ],
    "autoupdate": {
        "url": "https://github.com/qingjian-team/qingjian/releases/download/windows-v$version/qingjian-$version-windows-x86_64-setup.exe"
    }
}
